# deadlock (TODO fix)
# wallet_tests/runtime_loadwallet_attachchain_lifecycle deterministically holds
# a runtime-loaded wallet inside AttachChainUnpublished while validation
# notifications queue behind it, then proves catch-up precedes publication and
# real PoW worker startup. The phase helper holds that private wallet's
# cs_wallet across its rescan and chain reads. TSan retains this phase-disjoint
